#
# Pinned fields of brain.server.metrics v1 (but a replica's scheduler and a training job's report, pinned where they are made): one path per line, an array's items as [], a map keyed by data as .<key>.
# Fields are only ever added. Each one has its row in the metrics reference (make check/metrics-fields).
